Your live-site update process from now on

Before editing, make your backup copy:

cp ~/golf-league-site/src/App.jsx ~/golf-league-site/src/App-working-backup.jsx

Then after you make changes, run:

cd ~/golf-league-site
git add .
git commit -m "Describe the change"
git push

Because GitHub is connected to Vercel, every push to main will trigger a fresh deployment automatically.
